.TH LSUSB 1 "July 31, 2026" "ReBSD"
.SH NAME
lsusb \- list USB devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lsusb
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lsusb
prints one line for each connected device known to the common USB core.
The bus and device numbers and the USB vendor and product identifiers are
read from the read-only
.B hw.usbdevices
kernel snapshot.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sysctl (3)
